This is a sophisticated file transformation requirement involving dynamic parsing, conditional logic, and formatting rules driven by database configuration.
Below is the Production-Grade Solution designed with Spring Boot. I have focused on SOLID principles, specifically the Single Responsibility Principle (breaking logic into helper methods) and Open/Closed Principle (using regex-driven configurations).
